  ('8d4621dc-4a29-5c11-82ba-c772fed41108', 'daily-life', 'I finally <b>caught up on sleep</b> over the holidays.', 'B1', 125),
  ('73480451-c83e-569c-aa56-2b9cb3b59552', 'daily-life', 'I like to <b>wind down</b> with a book before bed.', 'A2', 126),
  ('663a5916-9b91-56b9-9c5c-a5cdb7ffdbb4', 'daily-life', 'Give me a sec to <b>wind down</b> — that was a stressful call.', 'B1', 127),
  ('05734b79-2d04-59d0-9f8f-2855b5060262', 'daily-life', 'A glass of wine helps me <b>wind down</b> after work.', 'B1', 128),
  ('2558c6bb-3ee3-5f80-a649-19cdc512e893', 'daily-life', 'Anyway, it''s getting late — <b>I should get going</b>.', 'B1', 129),
  ('2b822acb-5311-5b11-b945-2776304c58d7', 'daily-life', '<b>I should get going</b>, I''ve got an early start tomorrow.', 'B1', 130),
  ('5e191092-1404-55cc-8fa5-1ee89c9c34dd', 'daily-life', 'This was fun, but <b>I should probably get going</b>.', 'A2', 131),
  ('212d0e83-b3cb-5059-8d2f-4893c01cad03', 'daily-life', 'I''m totally <b>wiped out</b> after that double shift.', 'B2', 132),
  ('2956fc48-9ac7-5839-93f5-f3adeb78d5d6', 'daily-life', 'That long drive left me completely <b>wiped out</b>.', 'B1', 133),
  ('6b9e8ad7-15f2-519a-aebc-50983faf920e', 'daily-life', 'The kids are <b>wiped out</b> from the pool — they''ll be asleep in minutes.', 'C1', 134),
  ('b4ae4763-6cff-5c54-8ead-bce92e4540fa', 'small-talk', 'Hey man, <b>how''s it going</b>? Haven''t seen you around the office lately.', 'C1', 0),
  ('6b518f1f-eb8b-54ff-b23a-02bf9ce0c576', 'small-talk', '<b>How''s it going</b> today? You finding everything okay?', 'B1', 1),
  ('1e1cb2af-f914-5757-b62c-9f804c9dcda5', 'small-talk', 'Oh hey, <b>how''s it going</b>? I love that jacket, by the way.', 'C1', 2),
  ('7fd745c7-5d04-5a14-a700-cb21fdd487dc', 'small-talk', 'Yo, <b>what''s up</b>? You coming to the thing tonight?', 'B1', 3),
  ('f30f0284-0021-5cef-add4-b8d767233a62', 'small-talk', 'Hey, <b>what''s up</b>, man! It''s been forever.', 'B2', 4),
  ('5238a136-0330-5dd5-bb9d-c7230a66167b', 'small-talk', '<b>What''s up</b>? I saw you texted me earlier.', 'B1', 5),
  ('67fd1d35-7cbe-585f-9c1f-90914bfe786e', 'small-talk', 'Wow, it''s been forever - <b>how''ve you been</b>?', 'B2', 6),
  ('878db68b-dd59-5483-a498-b1378887d182', 'small-talk', 'Good to see you! So <b>how''ve you been</b>? Still at the same job?', 'A2', 7),
  ('1204e3c1-fef5-56dd-b452-d771d103940e', 'small-talk', 'Hey Sarah, <b>how''ve you been</b>? The kids must be huge now.', 'C1', 8),
  ('34d82acd-d779-56a0-93d4-94575f79f8bb', 'small-talk', 'Marcus! <b>Long time no see</b> - what have you been up to?', 'A1', 9),
  ('891d770a-b5c2-5939-a165-e2bd8acf28b0', 'small-talk', 'Well, <b>long time no see</b>! I was just thinking about you the other day.', 'A2', 10),
  ('5caa1e1e-d2e1-5e1f-bfe5-a86d67ea87bc', 'small-talk', '<b>Long time no see</b>, stranger. You look great.', 'A2', 11),
  ('b5c0c7db-302b-55be-bcce-3b29a6774b62', 'small-talk', 'Hey, so <b>good to see you</b>! It''s been way too long.', 'B2', 12),
  ('a0822e20-2c77-5062-9a05-67ff2b2f03e6', 'small-talk', '<b>Good to see you</b>, man. Thanks for coming out tonight.', 'A2', 13),
  ('09ca7ef8-39fa-5732-b827-23db1dc1e94c', 'small-talk', 'Oh wow, <b>good to see you</b> - how''s the family?', 'B2', 14),
  ('1a3b2054-266e-59eb-8295-38c4d489bdea', 'small-talk', 'So <b>what have you been up to</b> these days? Anything exciting?', 'A2', 15),
  ('79e184a9-978a-5c27-8f90-67f9f89f079a', 'small-talk', '<b>What have you been up to</b> lately? Still doing the photography thing?', 'A2', 16),
  ('0295fbb6-6d8b-535a-9f14-188929a09136', 'small-talk', 'Tell me everything - <b>what have you been up to</b>?', 'A1', 17),
  ('5118d6e7-6434-583c-a04f-0d8238b20356', 'small-talk', 'Hey! <b>It''s been a while</b>, huh? How are things?', 'C1', 18),
  ('c7cb47d8-1731-50eb-81ae-6907653cb627', 'small-talk', 'Wow, <b>it''s been a while</b> since we last talked.', 'B2', 19),
  ('1f04002b-b105-584d-af11-9c769bcee5b8', 'small-talk', '<b>It''s been a while</b>! I feel like I haven''t seen you since the wedding.', 'C1', 20),
  ('c1af2c5f-d461-5863-bf28-f1a403c3b26a', 'small-talk', 'Hey, <b>what''s new</b> with you? Anything going on?', 'B1', 21),
  ('e5db5fd7-8cdc-5b85-9cf3-d3917512274a', 'small-talk', 'So <b>what''s new</b>? Fill me in.', 'A1', 22),
  ('01224a28-8c83-51d1-9041-f1cc5a10965c', 'small-talk', '<b>What''s new</b>, man? How''s the new apartment?', 'A2', 23),
  ('005981f9-77e1-56c8-8f2c-fc9ceaec5d26', 'small-talk', 'Hi, I''m David - <b>nice to meet you</b>.', 'B1', 24),
  ('1856217e-74bb-55eb-a804-84f07ddd0522', 'small-talk', '<b>Nice to meet you</b>! I''ve heard so much about you.', 'B1', 25),
  ('2b06cee1-45b1-5b24-aa7c-f09fa9195301', 'small-talk', 'So <b>nice to finally meet you</b> in person after all those emails.', 'B1', 26),
  ('738b7eac-b2c5-5990-b73f-4c774a419ac2', 'small-talk', 'Hey, <b>how''s your day going</b>? Busy one?', 'B2', 27),
  ('61ab4ec4-2d68-5f7e-a136-c1c2906715f8', 'small-talk', '<b>How''s your day going</b> so far? Mine''s been crazy.', 'B1', 28),
  ('ef03d4aa-9518-5423-a36e-d9b89ab144ab', 'small-talk', 'Hi there - <b>how''s your day going</b>?', 'A1', 29),
  ('658fd2dc-09a9-580e-a808-1cd06ee9a928', 'small-talk', 'Hey there, <b>how are you doing</b>?', 'A1', 30),
  ('0cacff7b-bb04-5858-a6dc-8536d60a14f2', 'small-talk', '<b>How are you doing</b>? You holding up okay after last week?', 'B1', 31),
  ('98207106-312f-5a31-9edd-079bc5eca051', 'small-talk', 'So <b>how are you doing</b> these days? Everything good?', 'A1', 32),
  ('9704002b-6b86-5a42-96a3-d6eb7c331b8f', 'small-talk', '<b>Hey there</b>! I didn''t expect to run into you here.', 'C1', 33),
  ('36cc3ca4-fddf-540f-9cd4-64979eaedb30', 'small-talk', '<b>Hey there</b>, stranger! Where''ve you been hiding?', 'B2', 34),
  ('2e9d6158-94fb-5afd-af6f-21237310d219', 'small-talk', 'Oh, <b>hey there</b> - good timing, I was just about to call you.', 'B2', 35),
  ('bed9aec6-5b06-5c85-af61-21f6109bfe9b', 'small-talk', 'Wow, it''s really <b>nice out</b> today - want to grab lunch outside?', 'C1', 36),
  ('7fead2c7-824b-5f42-a967-d83e062667ed', 'small-talk', 'Finally some sun. It''s so <b>nice out</b> I might just walk home.', 'B2', 37),
  ('5571537d-ecf3-59a8-a404-4a0a81972ce0', 'small-talk', 'It''s <b>nice out</b>, huh? Perfect weather for the game later.', 'C1', 38),
  ('c811343c-976f-50ff-aea8-469342dcfc3b', 'small-talk', '<b>Crazy weather</b> we''re having, right? Sunny this morning, pouring now.', 'C1', 39),
  ('a4f093e0-3a85-5dfc-a403-5de33bfbfdf6', 'small-talk', 'Can you believe this <b>crazy weather</b>? It was snowing yesterday.', 'B1', 40),
  ('3c9f2be6-634d-581a-b6f9-96c782098cfa', 'small-talk', 'What is up with this <b>crazy weather</b>? I don''t even know how to dress anymore.', 'C1', 41),
  ('573da435-5e4d-5b11-8056-ff45b1066163', 'small-talk', 'It''s <b>supposed to</b> rain all weekend, so much for the hike.', 'B2', 42),
  ('a5eeaed7-f68a-5262-ae5d-aa5969b59996', 'small-talk', 'I heard it''s <b>supposed to</b> be nice on Saturday - finally.', 'B2', 43),
  ('b7dfc404-2fc1-514e-a7cf-0ddbc2992f04', 'small-talk', 'It was <b>supposed to</b> snow last night, but nothing happened.', 'B2', 44),
  ('1cbf2c92-4389-5fb6-894a-b421e3cea78f', 'small-talk', 'Morning! <b>How was your weekend</b>?', 'A2', 45),
  ('93cb118b-3980-5117-b47d-5c2bffee9025', 'small-talk', 'Hey, <b>how was your weekend</b>? Do anything fun?', 'B2', 46),
  ('bf5a0330-699f-5c4f-bb45-8e48f64f905b', 'small-talk', '<b>How was your weekend</b>? Mine flew by, as usual.', 'B2', 47),
  ('50a3fc23-04ad-59aa-8148-d2e3d135c668', 'small-talk', 'It''s Friday! <b>Any plans for the weekend</b>?', 'A2', 48),
  ('7cc7d5d8-e44d-5bbf-9f1a-d21aae066837', 'small-talk', '<b>Any plans for the weekend</b>, or just taking it easy?', 'A2', 49),
  ('00fa64aa-6fc1-53dd-bc01-2d4bd4c62365', 'small-talk', 'So, <b>any plans for the weekend</b>? The weather''s supposed to be great.', 'B1', 50),
  ('1a20affe-60a7-57a0-bed1-c758a17001ad', 'small-talk', 'Hey, good to see you! <b>Staying busy</b>?', 'B2', 51),
  ('e9734c52-5877-546e-a3c9-12d1d57ddddc', 'small-talk', 'Work''s been nuts, so, you know, <b>staying busy</b>.', 'B2', 52),
  ('64ac222a-7464-5516-8969-12e54851cfce', 'small-talk', 'How''ve you been? - Oh, <b>staying busy</b>, the usual.', 'B2', 53),
  ('e8860e52-3b11-5579-8493-3af566b31526', 'small-talk', 'What''d you do this weekend? - <b>Not much</b>, honestly. Just chilled.', 'B2', 54),
  ('aefb477c-e946-5fe3-b246-c5fae11a5445', 'small-talk', 'What''s new with you? - Eh, <b>not much</b>. Same old.', 'B1', 55),
  ('e95d118d-eadc-5ca2-ad81-149615c78e09', 'small-talk', 'You up to anything tonight? - <b>Not much</b>, might just stay in.', 'B1', 56),
  ('d1259223-508a-54fb-8d5a-ee8a5b6e1abb', 'small-talk', 'Honestly I just <b>took it easy</b> this weekend - slept in, watched a ton of TV.', 'C1', 57),
  ('00d0c7c7-a95e-5055-81c2-7a780e659826', 'small-talk', 'We <b>took it easy</b> on Sunday after the party Saturday night.', 'B1', 58),
  ('d35e14c0-f759-56c8-96ec-09beafa1d8b1', 'small-talk', 'I was wiped out, so I just <b>took it easy</b> at home.', 'B1', 59),
  ('e6a52736-5018-586c-bab0-7cf21dd87f7b', 'small-talk', 'Better grab some water - it''s <b>gonna be a hot one</b> today.', 'B2', 60),
  ('4256c1ef-e90f-57a7-bdc0-5d273d845540', 'small-talk', 'Weather guy says it''s <b>gonna be a hot one</b> this weekend.', 'C1', 61),
  ('b2f64f5c-2c6b-516d-8e01-fd2d47efdb29', 'small-talk', 'Ugh, another scorcher. <b>Gonna be a hot one</b> again.', 'B2', 62),
  ('eb36937f-479f-59e7-b487-6e7f58e5ac1c', 'small-talk', 'Alright, <b>I''ll let you go</b> — I know you''ve got a busy day.', 'B2', 63),
  ('70e4068a-afba-52e8-871e-eaf613477b1f', 'small-talk', 'Well, <b>I''ll let you go</b>, but it was great catching up.', 'B1', 64)
insert into public.sentences (id, deck_id, content, level_id, position) values
  ('0fcdf61c-cb11-5975-95fb-9b13c3cdd4b0', 'small-talk', 'I should run, so <b>I''ll let you go</b>. Talk soon!', 'B1', 65),
  ('50adf6f1-d20e-576b-8295-37052522c1e9', 'small-talk', '<b>Good seeing you</b>, man — we should grab a beer sometime.', 'B2', 66),
  ('1ebd55c3-f4fd-5dc5-a262-07e2bff17103', 'small-talk', 'It was <b>good seeing you</b> again! Tell Sarah I said hi.', 'B1', 67),
  ('9d46f593-59fb-5487-a832-9ab221d844ae', 'small-talk', '<b>Good seeing you</b>! Don''t be a stranger.', 'B1', 68),
  ('8e7a8fa1-82fc-594d-9806-71c0c0daadea', 'small-talk', 'Well, <b>nice meeting you</b>, Dave. Hope to see you around.', 'B1', 69),
  ('892e6258-4f5b-57f5-9e0a-c6b061950948', 'small-talk', 'It was really <b>nice meeting you</b> — good luck with the move!', 'B1', 70),
  ('879ebcd8-966e-59e4-96df-16ef7e3a7834', 'small-talk', '<b>Nice meeting you</b>! Let''s connect on LinkedIn.', 'B2', 71),
  ('7c6ce429-93eb-5190-bb8b-6927698a2208', 'small-talk', 'Okay, I''ll see you next week. <b>Take care</b>!', 'B2', 72),
  ('f67894e6-a3d5-5798-8cf2-405ee649a932', 'small-talk', '<b>Take care</b>, and say hi to the family for me.', 'A1', 73),
  ('ffeb948f-20e4-592f-a0cc-52afec90d3c7', 'small-talk', 'Thanks again for everything. <b>Take care</b> of yourself.', 'B1', 74),
  ('4a87c9c0-ebe1-5456-9983-c409c834c9cd', 'small-talk', 'We''ve got so much to talk about — <b>let''s catch up soon</b>.', 'B2', 75),
  ('69da40ac-29fe-5f50-9e1e-21c2de8b1ee1', 'small-talk', '<b>Let''s catch up soon</b>, okay? It''s been way too long.', 'C1', 76),
  ('d84b43a2-3130-58ab-b259-aae5cfbf987c', 'small-talk', 'I really have to run, but <b>let''s catch up soon</b> — coffee next week?', 'B2', 77),
  ('ef5cc42f-3775-5639-ac39-0288b428a65f', 'small-talk', 'This was fun — <b>we should hang out sometime</b>.', 'B1', 78),
  ('514aa2cc-756b-5a24-a7d3-0396311c9063', 'small-talk', 'Hey, <b>we should hang out</b> more, seriously.', 'B2', 79),
  ('b9fc0875-ab4e-5063-9281-f9a3c662f43a', 'small-talk', '<b>We should hang out sometime</b> when things calm down.', 'C1', 80),
  ('3f7c9fa6-c49f-5472-a8e4-c643b151d500', 'small-talk', 'Cool, sounds good. <b>Talk soon</b>!', 'B1', 81),
  ('9d12950c-c290-507b-8253-ab5a87fa4fbc', 'small-talk', 'Gotta run — <b>talk soon</b>, yeah?', 'B1', 82),
  ('8da55f38-438d-54a1-b7cc-fbfbe7670b64', 'small-talk', 'Thanks for the call. <b>Talk soon</b>.', 'A2', 83),
  ('b46e694e-99f7-5161-8833-dfaf3efb7e1f', 'small-talk', 'It was great working with you — <b>keep in touch</b>!', 'A1', 84),
  ('0e0996a0-97f8-5364-8fc5-aba7d479f49b', 'small-talk', 'Don''t be a stranger, okay? <b>Keep in touch</b>.', 'B2', 85),
  ('fbd0da29-1cb7-535f-ae44-da75b3c58527', 'small-talk', '<b>Keep in touch</b> — you''ve got my number.', 'A2', 86),
  ('b3822f99-3417-57c0-88df-7caa424838b1', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'It was one of those days, <b>you know</b>, where nothing goes right.', 'A2', 0),
  ('bb4933b3-6a62-5082-a7f1-3531c833c318', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'I didn''t want to make it a big thing, <b>you know</b>?', 'A2', 1),
  ('6c41f71b-6d28-5791-8af2-0897568dd3cb', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'He''s just, <b>you know</b>, a little intense sometimes.', 'B1', 2),
  ('1886007d-2fa7-5205-a867-63344a3bd780', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'I''ll be there around eight. <b>I mean</b>, maybe eight thirty, depending on traffic.', 'C2', 3),
  ('5756e088-aa99-55ff-8109-92e0defd189b', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>I mean</b>, it''s not the worst idea, but I''d do it differently.', 'B2', 4),
  ('85955910-a155-5f06-8dcb-79dc2d8f0aa9', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'He''s not rude exactly. <b>I mean</b>, he just doesn''t say much.', 'C1', 5),
  ('8fc8ff68-9a5c-5a34-92d1-f34f5d8886aa', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'It was, <b>like</b>, the best concert I''ve ever been to.', 'A2', 6),
  ('eaabefef-426e-5245-b147-ad1329108c4e', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'We waited for, <b>like</b>, two hours.', 'A1', 7),
  ('4a2e8955-31d9-5c0d-bfda-1e43159346e6', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'And she was <b>like</b>, ''No way,'' and I just laughed.', 'A1', 8),
  ('d116f4ce-4274-53d9-88b3-e50b80f5b0c2', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'I''m <b>kind of</b> tired, honestly. Can we do it tomorrow?', 'B2', 9),
  ('53ae5a1b-42e8-5ba3-9b7a-bae01a7780ad', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'It''s <b>kind of</b> a long story.', 'A1', 10),
  ('be29a228-1ee5-54b9-a004-9151edc268bc', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'I <b>kind of</b> regret saying that.', 'A2', 11),
  ('147f3ea7-3101-5fd3-a24c-6ad45bd6cc63', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '''Did you finish?'' ''<b>Sort of</b>. I''ve got the main part done.''', 'B2', 12),
  ('b3997fc3-610e-5d2e-bd70-618403af9ad4', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'It''s <b>sort of</b> blue, sort of gray - hard to describe.', 'B2', 13),
  ('0062e612-cfcd-5bac-8295-c7d48dcb21cc', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'I <b>sort of</b> knew it was coming.', 'A1', 14),
  ('cfa7a8c0-d8e7-5c59-9e7c-005c1394e11c', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '''Are you coming?'' ''<b>Well</b>, it depends on when we finish.''', 'B1', 15),
  ('661bcb80-42a0-54cd-82fe-899483c072b8', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Well</b>, I wouldn''t put it quite like that.', 'B1', 16),
  ('8d49c81b-8c11-5ab5-850c-4e84e573e15f', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Well</b>, that''s one way to look at it.', 'A1', 17),
  ('55e352c3-9d8c-5007-b1d5-cf98a946d7d8', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Um</b>, I think it was Tuesday? Let me check.', 'B2', 18),
  ('34ef533b-36f7-5128-a481-65c15e8c198a', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'The answer is, <b>uh</b>, forty-two, I believe.', 'B2', 19),
  ('e146a5da-4314-5405-a003-e7c4d042080e', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Um</b>, actually, can I say something?', 'B2', 20),
  ('8ebc7c72-4cff-586e-898f-2cf93c42bb2f', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Let me think</b>... I want to say it was around 2019?', 'A2', 21),
  ('47a1b7b4-20b6-5789-aa93-367b0ea87eff', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'Best restaurant downtown? <b>Let me think</b> for a sec.', 'B1', 22),
  ('c26c19bc-c66c-5f83-9bb4-f8b933c20572', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>Let me think</b> about it and I''ll get back to you.', 'A2', 23),
  ('d58a3ffe-32f5-5fc1-8a78-164fd4442b7f', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'He''s, <b>how do I put this</b>, not the most reliable guy.', 'B1', 24),
  ('19beec2d-01e1-5442-a05f-04e7d6a599ea', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'The results were - <b>how do I put this</b> - disappointing.', 'A2', 25),
  ('5cc5e567-afa4-512d-bc05-eb5b7ab67948', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>How do I put this</b> without sounding harsh? It just wasn''t good.', 'C1', 26),
  ('8512ff9b-4f2e-54c1-8fd6-ee6692d8ba08', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'We can grab coffee <b>or something</b> later.', 'B1', 27),
  ('79e58a3c-4320-5a67-9cff-54e7d1e3ff21', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'He said he was sick <b>or something</b>, I don''t remember exactly.', 'C1', 28),
  ('c4bc2271-3817-5498-9b53-7cb178d3157b', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', 'Just leave it on the desk <b>or something</b>.', 'A2', 29),
  ('8577c8da-eb56-51af-8d28-df7d83c0b0e3', 'native-fillers-conversation-glue', '<b>I don''t know</b>, it just feels like the wrong move to me.', 'B2', 30),
