  ('6cfe58dc-e26e-5b44-a347-eb4ba05b7d19', 'making-plans', 'Hey, I''m so sorry, but <b>something came up</b> and I can''t make it tonight.', 'C2', 66),
  ('37fc46bb-f361-55d4-a14f-77010b790ee2', 'making-plans', '<b>Something came up</b> at work, so I might be a little late — go ahead and order.', 'B2', 67),
  ('38527dce-3aff-5507-9614-5477c1211bc9', 'making-plans', 'We had to cancel Sunday because <b>something came up</b> with the kids.', 'B1', 68),
  ('7b496947-064c-5e40-a085-2fd40355776b', 'making-plans', 'I''m wiped out tonight — can I <b>take a rain check</b> on drinks?', 'C1', 69),
  ('7406a71b-014e-588d-bd2b-e2638a079ad7', 'making-plans', 'Mind if I <b>take a rain check</b>? I promise we''ll do it next week.', 'C1', 70),
  ('b4a3031f-84be-5f73-8f07-ddacd8fe5ffe', 'making-plans', '"Movie tonight?" "I''ve gotta <b>take a rain check</b>, but text me next time you go."', 'C2', 71),
  ('e15f99eb-ef88-5519-9ba1-fbd002bc0644', 'making-plans', 'Can we <b>push it back</b> an hour? I''m stuck in traffic.', 'B2', 72),
  ('bc736a72-f015-57d7-bd58-6b8ae7852a20', 'making-plans', 'Let''s <b>push it back</b> to next week — this week''s crazy for me.', 'B2', 73),
  ('7aa7a5f0-45b1-584d-995c-e5172869a433', 'making-plans', 'They asked to <b>push it back</b> to 3 instead of 1, if that''s cool with you.', 'B1', 74),
  ('02c8f2a3-0a3d-55c4-a0b4-92603b65c4d3', 'socializing', 'We should <b>hang out</b> this weekend, it''s been forever.', 'B2', 0),
  ('0e0bda27-f305-57e0-aa43-dbdb58e5756a', 'socializing', 'They''re just <b>hanging out</b> at Jake''s place if you wanna swing by.', 'C1', 1),
  ('0741f1a2-5423-5295-bfa0-0f76d1979988', 'socializing', 'You wanna come <b>hang out</b> for a bit? Nothing special going on.', 'B2', 2),
  ('c0fbcdcd-c392-5755-bd08-67d9473b815b', 'socializing', 'We''re <b>having a few people over</b> Friday if you''re free.', 'B1', 3),
  ('42ca0d54-9181-5aa2-978a-948ca64b05ed', 'socializing', 'I don''t <b>have people over</b> much since the baby.', 'B1', 4),
  ('55a8d042-82a5-519f-ad49-f3c60a28b047', 'socializing', 'They <b>had us over</b> for dinner last week and it was great.', 'A2', 5),
  ('da984a77-90bd-557b-90a8-c15d79a24d22', 'socializing', '<b>Feel free to</b> bring someone if you want, the more the merrier.', 'B1', 6),
  ('c15bcc2b-ceac-55b1-98e6-8c414a4a881d', 'socializing', '<b>Feel free to</b> grab whatever you want from the fridge.', 'B2', 7),
  ('b83a3a1f-6617-5e78-bafb-6e374a513bec', 'socializing', 'The pool''s open, so <b>feel free to</b> jump in.', 'A2', 8),
  ('f75c07f0-d2e5-5ca2-803f-e28acdab7feb', 'socializing', 'There''s beer in the cooler — <b>help yourself</b>.', 'B1', 9),
  ('9fdde412-9594-5d8e-88b3-4e6a0a67993e', 'socializing', '<b>Help yourself</b> to whatever''s in the fridge, seriously.', 'B1', 10),
  ('51da4ba3-afbc-5a25-99c7-494fe654a8e9', 'socializing', 'Snacks are on the table, everyone <b>help yourselves</b>!', 'A2', 11),
  ('cc60503a-c700-5d8d-8512-b7b4eba4ca11', 'socializing', 'Come in, come in — <b>make yourself at home</b>.', 'A1', 12),
  ('2ae917bf-9a90-51a8-9d21-8031b72f4c95', 'socializing', 'I''ll be like five minutes; <b>make yourself at home</b>.', 'B1', 13),
  ('4eeb3dc5-045f-552d-86dd-76eadc74cb04', 'socializing', '<b>Make yourself at home</b>, there''s coffee if you want some.', 'B1', 14),
  ('81b3a2ec-e666-5c81-89c0-6cc187eaca02', 'socializing', 'We should <b>get together</b> soon — it''s been way too long.', 'B1', 15),
  ('eea237f6-7d3a-55d2-a38a-607a3b33ed54', 'socializing', 'They''re having a little <b>get-together</b> at their place Saturday.', 'B1', 16),
  ('b66b24bf-ea8c-5481-a767-2cf0a90659e5', 'socializing', 'Let''s <b>get together</b> for coffee sometime next week.', 'B2', 17),
  ('afc49087-50b0-57c4-9a74-1383032364d9', 'socializing', 'This was so fun — <b>thanks for having me</b>!', 'A1', 18),
  ('4180866d-f281-5c6e-bc02-c09b8a6558bd', 'socializing', 'We''re gonna head out. <b>Thanks for having us</b>, everyone.', 'B2', 19),
  ('23085b8c-5738-50af-8b10-fb31c9cf190d', 'socializing', '<b>Thanks for having me</b>, dinner was amazing.', 'B1', 20),
  ('ac6799f7-b5b0-5d47-8129-12d57984ff26', 'socializing', 'Sure, bring your roommate too — <b>the more the merrier</b>!', 'B2', 21),
  ('b4258c57-1627-5eec-8379-49fa5151e3ec', 'socializing', 'Can my cousins tag along? — Of course, <b>the more the merrier</b>.', 'B2', 22),
  ('89048a9a-265b-54c3-9e6b-029d1eae1bb0', 'socializing', 'We''ve got plenty of food, so honestly <b>the more the merrier</b>.', 'B2', 23),
  ('9835aec0-e61c-5500-8daf-e2887ee11c5f', 'socializing', 'Hey! <b>Come on in</b>, everyone''s in the kitchen.', 'B1', 24),
  ('f41a0c0c-1c38-5a95-83c4-d9fa40df44f8', 'socializing', '<b>Come on in</b>, don''t worry about your shoes.', 'B2', 25),
  ('b8a5ff6e-ac89-5fca-b454-dc4f195ae522', 'socializing', 'There you are — <b>come on in</b>, let me take your coat.', 'A2', 26),
  ('b96644a6-a4ab-543f-bd20-e009e2f7f463', 'socializing', 'Welcome! <b>Can I get you anything</b> — water, coffee, a beer?', 'B1', 27),
  ('b8f4c85e-0467-5456-8ed4-31e6d81c183a', 'socializing', 'Have a seat. <b>Can I get you anything</b> to drink?', 'A2', 28),
  ('78c49bc7-1b2c-5084-99ae-382a5981f084', 'socializing', '<b>Can I get you guys anything</b> before the movie starts?', 'A2', 29),
  ('5ee8a491-28dd-502f-ba18-dc8dc65dc640', 'socializing', 'The invite says I can <b>bring a plus-one</b>, so do you wanna come?', 'B2', 30),
  ('86455783-f214-51f4-9400-c234eb9e0de6', 'socializing', 'Am I allowed to <b>bring a plus-one</b> to the wedding?', 'A2', 31),
  ('c335381e-e38c-5efb-853d-625980669564', 'socializing', 'She''s <b>bringing a plus-one</b> to the office party.', 'A2', 32),
  ('40f552a8-fe06-50ba-b933-dd5a1f8596ce', 'socializing', 'I hate that first-meeting silence, so I usually crack a joke just to <b>break the ice</b>.', 'C1', 33),
  ('40cda15d-5c61-5656-9b94-c9978aa6f3cb', 'socializing', 'They had everyone share one weird fact about themselves to <b>break the ice</b>.', 'B2', 34),
  ('0ab0232f-1312-53ee-9b31-08642c6a2b86', 'socializing', 'Somebody''s gotta <b>break the ice</b> here, nobody''s talking.', 'B2', 35),
  ('9b092edf-43b2-565a-a7ca-ff67a542673c', 'socializing', 'I introduced her to my roommate and they totally <b>hit it off</b>.', 'B1', 36),
  ('9b667891-2ef8-5b3e-a578-c84d409d587c', 'socializing', 'We met at a wedding and just <b>hit it off</b> right away.', 'B1', 37),
  ('3040385f-a341-541f-841e-954195b29a28', 'socializing', 'I thought it''d be awkward, but we really <b>hit it off</b>.', 'B2', 38),
  ('1e7b8560-69b4-522a-bdac-2528fdbd1104', 'socializing', 'You wanna <b>grab a drink</b> after this?', 'B1', 39),
  ('5431c686-321e-5a9e-a952-fa23b500d4ac', 'socializing', 'We should <b>grab a drink</b> sometime and catch up.', 'B2', 40)
insert into public.sentences (id, deck_id, content, level_id, position) values
  ('58e05a77-b458-5fde-af31-08366ea2bfb5', 'socializing', 'A bunch of us are gonna <b>grab a drink</b> downstairs, come with.', 'C1', 41),
  ('04b05498-1d9d-5524-893e-a6f2ff762719', 'socializing', 'I''m beat, I think I''m gonna <b>call it a night</b>.', 'B2', 42),
  ('f92fb65c-fe56-5746-9faa-52e0a6d6244c', 'socializing', 'One more drink and then let''s <b>call it a night</b>.', 'A2', 43),
  ('fcadb41a-3397-55a0-b83a-680bfa916c14', 'socializing', 'It''s almost 2 a.m., we should probably <b>call it a night</b>.', 'B1', 44),
  ('1d79c2fa-56c9-5b69-a66b-7d4cc8581404', 'socializing', 'We haven''t had <b>a night out</b> in ages, let''s do something Friday.', 'B2', 45),
  ('9a5b58cd-e774-56d1-92a7-693d7f94a86a', 'socializing', 'It was supposed to be a chill dinner but it turned into a full <b>night out</b>.', 'B2', 46),
  ('ed0600b8-31a8-5a57-b45f-8f040c581843', 'socializing', 'The girls are planning <b>a night out</b> for her birthday.', 'A2', 47),
  ('6138d4a5-0481-5410-9d05-98e8b742f3c4', 'socializing', 'Once he''s had a couple drinks he becomes <b>the life of the party</b>.', 'B2', 48),
  ('2e49a3be-931a-56a5-8ce2-ca27fb06e0e8', 'socializing', 'She''s so outgoing, always <b>the life of the party</b>.', 'A2', 49),
  ('12d1f9bc-767b-54ee-8fd5-a070a75b0758', 'socializing', 'Invite Marco, he''s <b>the life of the party</b>.', 'B1', 50),
  ('fa728e91-7ad1-57aa-83f8-6985ec79edda', 'socializing', 'Grab a drink and go <b>mingle</b>, you don''t know anyone yet.', 'C1', 51),
  ('9b6d9133-7909-576b-8583-0613cd0c10d8', 'socializing', 'I''m gonna <b>mingle</b> a bit, I''ll find you later.', 'B2', 52),
  ('11d88bd2-8444-5f71-84f4-ffda473e6d2f', 'socializing', 'The whole point of these networking things is to <b>mingle</b>.', 'A2', 53),
  ('47f42883-1fed-5753-8c12-e3bb1b9deb44', 'socializing', 'I''m terrible at <b>small talk</b>, I never know what to say.', 'B2', 54),
  ('c831703b-c1f3-54d8-9a19-ea57e99975cb', 'socializing', 'We made <b>small talk</b> by the snack table for a few minutes.', 'B1', 55),
  ('b0ed06ba-8acb-5ce7-9f1d-9aa9f72636fb', 'socializing', 'He skipped the <b>small talk</b> and got straight to the point.', 'B1', 56),
  ('e5ee6629-b2e6-5b48-b6c2-e4c95330c99b', 'socializing', 'Barely anyone <b>showed up</b> to her party, it was kind of sad.', 'B2', 57),
  ('79de59c6-5fb3-5ea3-a503-10f74d979d80', 'socializing', 'He <b>showed up</b> two hours late like it was no big deal.', 'B1', 58),
  ('b9c08aa9-fbae-5566-855e-486cc12d1388', 'socializing', 'Just <b>show up</b>, you don''t need to bring anything.', 'B2', 59),
  ('e1d104ce-0e5f-57ed-a9b5-424c181775d0', 'socializing', 'This party''s dead, wanna <b>bail</b>?', 'B1', 60),
  ('1cb8a75b-eb90-51f8-9cbd-98f811744fdf', 'socializing', 'Sorry I <b>bailed</b> last night, I was exhausted.', 'B2', 61),
  ('7522c8e6-b7e7-59b5-a6df-9e5f7e095ca1', 'socializing', 'He said he''d come but he <b>bailed</b> on us again.', 'B1', 62),
  ('a903cb5a-fc64-5239-897f-ccfb9a5f5b23', 'socializing', 'Guess who I <b>ran into</b> at the party last night?', 'B1', 63),
  ('0f0b6c43-b2ef-5a44-8d2b-f856945640dc', 'socializing', 'I <b>ran into</b> an old coworker at the bar, totally random.', 'B2', 64),
  ('a82b84d4-a1ef-574f-83e9-011a0bce6848', 'socializing', 'If you <b>run into</b> Sarah, tell her I said hi.', 'B1', 65),
  ('ec52deb2-ed35-5fe2-ac95-a3dee3ca7676', 'socializing', 'Am I allowed a <b>plus one</b>, or is it just me?', 'A2', 66),
  ('ec26c49b-1488-5b1a-916e-b8ae6ba4ed6e', 'socializing', 'She brought her boyfriend as her <b>plus one</b>.', 'B1', 67),
  ('c0274039-253d-5e46-9853-1e70704be4f3', 'socializing', 'I don''t have a date, so you can be my <b>plus one</b>.', 'B1', 68),
  ('37f8d3ae-bcfa-50fc-9dd3-e831c5e08124', 'problem-solving', 'We were halfway through the migration when we <b>ran into a problem</b> with the old database.', 'C1', 0),
  ('0fb57142-a152-5e22-977b-f4c069d76ec4', 'problem-solving', 'If you <b>run into any problems</b> during setup, just shoot me a message.', 'B2', 1),
  ('a7233627-42e2-55f3-aaf3-c4517b07f461', 'problem-solving', 'I <b>ran into a bit of a problem</b> trying to get the two systems to talk to each other.', 'B2', 2),
  ('4e0407e7-d5f7-5a7a-97d2-9eb5bd5365c7', 'problem-solving', 'We were on track to ship Friday, but we <b>hit a snag</b> with the payment integration.', 'B2', 3),
  ('420f2771-c16f-543a-b68c-9dfe74312654', 'problem-solving', 'The remodel <b>hit a snag</b> when the inspector flagged the wiring.', 'C1', 4),
  ('6def1fe7-510e-55a9-bb5e-e3b42093c916', 'problem-solving', 'Everything was going great until we <b>hit a snag</b> with customs.', 'B2', 5),
  ('2b62a0be-5c7f-598d-8518-20ab1f108c40', 'problem-solving', 'Let''s stop patching symptoms and figure out <b>the root of the problem</b>.', 'B2', 6),
  ('0a7edfdd-6758-5b16-b978-6d8f3b215c3e', 'problem-solving', 'Turns out <b>the root of the problem</b> was one misconfigured setting.', 'B1', 7),
  ('a11034bb-4689-57e1-ae3d-02aadc013944', 'problem-solving', 'Until we deal with <b>the root of the problem</b>, this is just going to keep happening.', 'B2', 8),
  ('ed6e68a7-ebe5-5ced-b168-cdd624364a1b', 'problem-solving', 'The approval step is the real <b>bottleneck</b> — everything just sits there waiting.', 'B2', 9),
  ('f7366446-6d50-5045-baf7-abf872e16592', 'problem-solving', 'We added more servers, but the database is still the <b>bottleneck</b>.', 'A2', 10),
  ('6b5e1af6-3d32-5b5a-94b9-7cacac6f34b6', 'problem-solving', 'Honestly, I think I''m the <b>bottleneck</b> here; I can''t review everything fast enough.', 'C2', 11),
  ('92969577-815c-5c22-acb1-9a3edda3b9da', 'problem-solving', 'The salary''s fine, but no remote work? That''s a <b>dealbreaker</b> for me.', 'B2', 12),
  ('0d73daed-81e0-579d-b50f-6a7fd0818e66', 'problem-solving', 'It''s a nice apartment, but the lack of parking is a <b>dealbreaker</b>.', 'B2', 13),
  ('fc6955db-4f26-5ca4-9b02-69795bdf21d3', 'problem-solving', 'The bug itself isn''t a <b>dealbreaker</b>, but we can''t launch until it''s fixed.', 'C2', 14),
  ('3f304c31-386b-5050-abc4-7d624f1a9fdf', 'problem-solving', 'You can get it for free, but <b>there''s a catch</b> — you have to commit for a year.', 'B2', 15),
  ('a95c58f0-7e80-5e9c-8a49-e9b41f4093eb', 'problem-solving', 'The plan works, but <b>there''s a catch</b>: it only runs on the newest phones.', 'B1', 16),
  ('3940dbd6-c334-5bbd-bce9-5f2e9fcc244d', 'problem-solving', 'It looks too good to be true, and sure enough, <b>there''s a catch</b>.', 'B2', 17),
  ('9e92a012-0a65-57f0-840b-29202538cb80', 'problem-solving', 'Sure, just ''stay calm and rewrite the whole thing'' — <b>easier said than done</b>.', 'C1', 18),
  ('0edadd7a-db83-5cfc-bd7d-11258e7b6b09', 'problem-solving', 'Cutting costs sounds great, but it''s <b>easier said than done</b> when everyone''s already stretched.', 'C2', 19),
  ('89bd7faa-f880-5afd-a6bf-5426c540ba76', 'problem-solving', '''Just talk to your boss about it.'' Yeah, <b>easier said than done</b>.', 'C1', 20),
  ('fb3bda2c-df32-5b65-bf89-720394e85c85', 'problem-solving', 'Whether that counts as a business expense is kind of a <b>gray area</b>.', 'B2', 21),
  ('db45074d-3e57-5afe-9140-c1e8f8c9cf1d', 'problem-solving', 'The rules don''t really cover this case, so we''re in a <b>gray area</b>.', 'C1', 22),
  ('95232a33-2ffc-5de4-b597-b72cbf5e1475', 'problem-solving', 'It''s a legal <b>gray area</b>, so we should probably ask someone before we do it.', 'C1', 23),
  ('f9fa75f9-a213-5eea-9488-11aa974dca21', 'problem-solving', 'Okay, let''s address <b>the elephant in the room</b> — are we going to make the deadline or not?', 'C1', 24),
  ('d4673136-7a5d-59bc-bba6-b3813ec9323d', 'problem-solving', 'Nobody wanted to mention it, but the budget was <b>the elephant in the room</b> the whole meeting.', 'C1', 25),
  ('48b14534-3801-5dd0-8669-7eddcefe66bd', 'problem-solving', 'Can we finally talk about <b>the elephant in the room</b>? The project is way over budget.', 'B2', 26),
  ('78d188de-42b0-532a-b400-d4188abed912', 'problem-solving', 'That outage was bad, but honestly it''s just <b>the tip of the iceberg</b>.', 'C1', 27),
  ('9ec9a2f8-09e1-5df9-9124-4a11ba53515a', 'problem-solving', 'The complaints we''ve seen are <b>the tip of the iceberg</b> — most people don''t even bother reporting it.', 'C2', 28),
  ('fd0bff69-b8bd-5130-926b-2929904c06a9', 'problem-solving', 'Fixing this one bug helps, but it''s <b>the tip of the iceberg</b>.', 'B2', 29),
  ('02bb6704-a85b-58b3-8bea-21a0f3e7f763', 'problem-solving', 'With so many tickets coming in, a few requests <b>fell through the cracks</b>.', 'B2', 30),
  ('c45cc4d5-5e31-5483-a2b0-b441baaee8ea', 'problem-solving', 'We need a better system so nothing <b>falls through the cracks</b>.', 'B1', 31),
  ('6b37ab85-e565-549a-a122-7e6c7d812c15', 'problem-solving', 'Her case just <b>fell through the cracks</b> — nobody was assigned to follow up.', 'C1', 32),
  ('512c9d7e-09f3-50c4-afe3-91c8e144492f', 'problem-solving', 'I asked one question about the billing and it <b>opened a whole can of worms</b>.', 'B1', 33),
  ('5c5b6921-6fe4-57a0-840f-67fb56802215', 'problem-solving', 'Let''s not <b>open that can of worms</b> right before the release.', 'B1', 34),
  ('9fdb211a-6334-5d57-b73a-6150bd2f0de2', 'problem-solving', 'Renaming the files sounds simple, but it <b>opens a real can of worms</b> with all the links.', 'B1', 35),
  ('90884b62-3592-5c0b-bbb7-a9535de1dd16', 'problem-solving', 'The supplier backing out really <b>threw a wrench in</b> our timeline.', 'B2', 36),
  ('ce17646e-e36a-5e32-8704-e545e848679f', 'problem-solving', 'One person calling in sick can <b>throw a wrench into</b> the whole schedule.', 'C1', 37),
  ('f0042a75-8b94-510e-aa4a-13cbe63e71b9', 'problem-solving', 'The new regulation <b>threw a wrench in the works</b> just as we were about to launch.', 'B2', 38),
  ('ba19009a-7585-5ff6-910a-20c580917a32', 'problem-solving', 'Working from home is a <b>double-edged sword</b> — more freedom, but you never really log off.', 'B2', 39),
  ('c69af105-d7d8-55fb-86eb-c4f2862f9d0b', 'problem-solving', 'The publicity is a <b>double-edged sword</b>; it brings customers but also a lot of scrutiny.', 'C1', 40),
  ('f5f45c90-14e5-572c-a757-595fdb512e8a', 'problem-solving', 'Automating it is a <b>double-edged sword</b> — faster, but harder to debug when it breaks.', 'C1', 41),
  ('51f8845f-5be6-5199-a027-eac6a2660292', 'problem-solving', 'I don''t know how the new system works yet, but give me an hour and I''ll <b>figure it out</b>.', 'C2', 42),
  ('952f5699-723b-52bd-9102-f9ceb2e00a9a', 'problem-solving', 'We couldn''t <b>figure out</b> why the app kept crashing until we checked the logs.', 'C2', 43),
  ('c423a656-7915-5b3c-8372-23ca11c41e32', 'problem-solving', 'Don''t worry about who sits where, we''ll <b>figure it out</b> when everyone shows up.', 'C2', 44),
  ('5906607a-ee00-5155-adc5-6b241acd2608', 'problem-solving', 'We need to <b>come up with</b> a plan before the client call tomorrow.', 'B1', 45),
  ('96db16bb-897c-524d-bbee-12df939665e5', 'problem-solving', 'How did you <b>come up with</b> that solution so fast?', 'A2', 46),
  ('bc0cf5cb-255e-559c-8bc9-efc9e3c48665', 'problem-solving', 'I''m drawing a blank, I can''t <b>come up with</b> anything better right now.', 'C1', 47),
  ('98db126f-f187-5cdc-9120-0da8d6786d2d', 'problem-solving', 'We can''t move the deadline, so we''ll just have to <b>work around it</b>.', 'B2', 48),
  ('56a90734-cc19-5f71-960d-f465ea2c05c6', 'problem-solving', 'The API doesn''t support that yet, but there''s a way to <b>work around</b> the limitation.', 'C2', 49),
  ('0e2a1422-e448-5a22-96e0-65b2a8513a08', 'problem-solving', 'One of the machines is down, but the team figured out how to <b>work around it</b> for now.', 'B1', 50),
  ('8d10b7e8-e62c-50f3-8744-cbc8b032dfd7', 'problem-solving', 'There''ve been three outages this week and we need to <b>get to the bottom of</b> it.', 'B2', 51),
  ('5b5027c5-f736-5d68-93f4-b030ee804310', 'problem-solving', 'I don''t know why the numbers don''t match, but I''m going to <b>get to the bottom of</b> this.', 'C2', 52),
  ('332ed1c1-63c2-5bbc-8076-7bb893d8731e', 'problem-solving', 'Let''s talk to the team and <b>get to the bottom of</b> what actually happened.', 'B2', 53),
  ('bb022bc4-ad87-5e9f-a950-3b1abc3afa45', 'problem-solving', 'The deal is basically done, we just need to <b>iron out</b> a few details.', 'B2', 54),
  ('875526ca-c55e-5405-8123-43d92d72f509', 'problem-solving', 'There are still some bugs to <b>iron out</b> before we ship.', 'B1', 55),
  ('701b582c-91fb-568b-a675-ee6458d803b6', 'problem-solving', 'Let''s grab coffee and <b>iron out</b> who''s doing what.', 'B2', 56),
  ('5c90e99f-6387-5f17-a175-64d6ecb90798', 'problem-solving', 'Don''t stress about the billing error, I''ll call them and <b>sort it out</b>.', 'C1', 57),
  ('feac54aa-4104-57b4-a2d6-38ca82d3a90f', 'problem-solving', 'You two need to <b>sort out</b> your differences before the meeting.', 'A2', 58),
  ('5d5b74f0-2e63-5f2f-93bb-f709d0e44a90', 'problem-solving', 'There was a mix-up with the order, but we got it <b>sorted out</b>.', 'A2', 59),
  ('52b8f742-fbfa-571e-ba5b-f650e2aa5def', 'problem-solving', 'Before we start, let''s agree on a <b>game plan</b>.', 'A2', 60),
  ('23eed1a9-e304-52eb-bb34-e0a7ad876971', 'problem-solving', 'We went in without a <b>game plan</b> and it showed.', 'A1', 61),
  ('7bd66827-a3e7-53c2-aa8c-3d73e8b54299', 'problem-solving', 'Okay, what''s our <b>game plan</b> for clearing the backlog?', 'C1', 62),
  ('37efb273-4273-5ffe-83a2-05df1d87ef69', 'problem-solving', 'The usual fixes aren''t working, so we need to <b>think outside the box</b>.', 'C1', 63),
  ('43b6f22b-d2c2-5f35-8528-10f5cf8d5744', 'problem-solving', 'I love that idea, that''s really <b>thinking outside the box</b>.', 'B1', 64),
  ('c096c0ed-a48d-591a-ab83-709cb7b5c992', 'problem-solving', 'They hired her because she <b>thinks outside the box</b>.', 'B1', 65),
  ('7884f97f-37cd-5534-909e-8d4f16da1ab0', 'problem-solving', 'I still can''t <b>wrap my head around</b> how this bug even happens.', 'C1', 66),
  ('aa0e86b2-9d89-545e-9640-38e17d38e1fa', 'problem-solving', 'Give me a second to <b>wrap my head around</b> what you''re proposing.', 'C1', 67),
  ('112b5f23-5179-5d67-902f-cf317d0357b1', 'problem-solving', 'It took me a while to <b>wrap my head around</b> the new pricing model.', 'B1', 68),
  ('2c6eb2c4-47b1-5837-9a87-6bfe568dc1b2', 'problem-solving', 'We <b>ran into</b> a few issues during last night''s deployment.', 'C1', 69),
  ('e9759653-2a4e-5a3c-962e-7a9c7a9b5cae', 'problem-solving', 'If you <b>run into</b> any problems, just message me.', 'A2', 70),
  ('4bfd14c1-e69e-5d95-b1f8-22aabd63c129', 'problem-solving', 'I <b>ran into</b> a wall trying to get the two systems to talk to each other.', 'B1', 71),
  ('f00555a6-17f5-589f-9c5f-fab17ce1f9e1', 'problem-solving', 'The prototype didn''t work at all, so it''s <b>back to the drawing board</b>.', 'C1', 72),
  ('c981e11c-b914-5bf9-b246-8818ef311bd3', 'problem-solving', 'Client rejected all three designs, so it''s <b>back to the drawing board</b>, I guess.', 'C1', 73),
  ('4f1c8b45-b3a1-5183-b60f-7a8ba36a4437', 'problem-solving', 'That approach was a dead end, so we went <b>back to the drawing board</b>.', 'B1', 74),
  ('79241a9e-4401-5830-8a1b-acb614a65116', 'problem-solving', 'There''s a lot on our plate, but let''s <b>tackle it</b> one thing at a time.', 'B2', 75),
  ('9f4c4dab-8056-5bea-83fa-f03a02b5f097', 'problem-solving', 'I finally decided to just <b>tackle it</b> head-on instead of putting it off.', 'B2', 76),
  ('0aa56d3f-5b32-5017-8e86-bc7fe90cf269', 'problem-solving', 'The bug list looks scary, but we can <b>tackle it</b> if we prioritize.', 'C1', 77),
  ('90a27e46-f95b-569c-9ec5-ee3570a0ae48', 'emotions-opinions', 'I''ve been so <b>stressed out</b> this week - three deadlines and my car broke down.', 'C1', 0),
  ('877704b2-5192-543f-9cd9-b34237d52d07', 'emotions-opinions', 'Don''t get <b>stressed out</b> about the interview, you''re totally ready.', 'C1', 1),
  ('4507a481-6920-5ce7-85db-b55c3a092df3', 'emotions-opinions', 'She''s completely <b>stressed out</b> trying to plan the whole wedding by herself.', 'C1', 2),
  ('56aee041-e8c0-55b2-9ad7-35a7ebe9fff4', 'emotions-opinions', 'After two years with no vacation, I''m totally <b>burnt out</b>.', 'B2', 3),
  ('f23b058e-9520-5e9c-8798-54c45e6a1e23', 'emotions-opinions', 'A lot of teachers are <b>burnt out</b> by the end of the school year.', 'B1', 4),
  ('d6b72e0c-3dbf-56e8-9ba2-82dfc88d38f2', 'emotions-opinions', 'I love my job, but doing 12-hour days left me completely <b>burnt out</b>.', 'B2', 5),
  ('f01d1c30-60b1-5107-85df-93efad8ce54f', 'emotions-opinions', 'I''m so <b>fed up with</b> this traffic - I''m going to start taking the train.', 'C1', 6),
  ('d43e6f34-8e5d-5649-bc40-2bde15909cdd', 'emotions-opinions', 'She finally quit; she was just <b>fed up</b>.', 'B2', 7),
