  ('c9216fde-2182-5e18-819f-16d2024561c6', 'emotions-opinions', 'She seemed <b>down in the dumps</b>, so I brought her a coffee.', 'B2', 23),
  ('73fd651d-a6c3-5b71-a15f-725d10acf07d', 'emotions-opinions', 'I was so <b>bummed out</b> when they cancelled the concert.', 'B1', 24),
