  ('e70c0773-2a79-5ede-a6cd-1e7967921397', 'emotions-opinions', '<b>That''s a good point</b>, but I still think we should try.', 'B1', 62),
  ('478ab370-f88b-5fd6-9e89-5f203a744347', 'emotions-opinions', 'Oh, <b>that makes sense</b>, no wonder he was upset.', 'C1', 63),
  ('7ea5222a-2e9e-5184-9d68-b64816030168', 'emotions-opinions', '<b>Makes sense</b>. Let''s do it that way then.', 'A1', 64),
  ('c42fea58-3d92-54b9-ba61-8fbe0c181def', 'emotions-opinions', 'Yeah, when you put it like that, <b>it makes sense</b>.', 'B1', 65),
