  ('eee29b1c-7831-55a8-bc87-afa0633b956f', 'emotions-opinions', 'Okay, <b>I see your point</b>, maybe I was being unfair.', 'B2', 67),
  ('92fe3fd0-44a6-5f75-8e02-d7bbfe04b2f2', 'emotions-opinions', '<b>I see your point</b> about the timing.', 'A1', 68),
  ('c722bd1d-a982-56b1-872f-d9f3ee7868ff', 'emotions-opinions', '<b>I hear you</b>, this week has been exhausting.', 'A2', 69),
  ('f5057397-c415-5adf-b510-b052f5df92dd', 'emotions-opinions', 'Yeah, <b>I hear you</b>, traffic was insane today too.', 'C1', 70),
  ('c54ed712-bcf6-57ac-9270-262270259807', 'emotions-opinions', '<b>I hear you</b>, but there''s not much we can do about it.', 'A2', 71),
  ('f41f64b9-5524-592f-8cd9-45594e701102', 'emotions-opinions', 'I''d never pay that much for a coffee, but <b>to each their own</b>.', 'B1', 72),
  ('ba583c7d-626f-564c-bcff-e05d9ceee043', 'emotions-opinions', 'He loves pineapple on pizza. <b>To each their own</b>, I guess.', 'B2', 73),
  ('a5a309b5-13a1-5454-a408-d5eaf3724747', 'emotions-opinions', 'You don''t like the beach? <b>To each their own</b>.', 'A2', 74),
  ('a5a02dd0-d4e1-547e-a202-a82659e87b56', 'emotions-opinions', 'Calling it ''the best restaurant in town''? <b>That''s a stretch</b>.', 'B1', 75),
