  ('f0094145-445a-57f1-8254-19871b37228f', 'emotions-opinions', 'Saying he''s a genius is <b>a stretch</b>, if you ask me.', 'B2', 77),
  ('1c9a9de2-b786-597f-8cba-124e49bfe00f', 'emotions-opinions', 'The ending of that show <b>blew my mind</b>.', 'A2', 78),
