  ('a5c34dff-c25a-5e81-992c-b447be53f371', 'restaurants', 'Oh, I''m <b>still working on it</b>, thanks.', 'B1', 12),
  ('dd264499-64ad-5f34-895a-c1326d5ea195', 'restaurants', 'Can you leave that? She''s <b>still working on it</b>.', 'A1', 13),
  ('182ddf77-a8de-583f-92ed-ddcfe13112a1', 'restaurants', 'No, no, I''m <b>still working on it</b> - just taking my time.', 'A2', 14),
  ('b9ae6740-0139-53e2-aa39-ec684b721f47', 'restaurants', 'That sounds good - <b>I''ll have the same</b>.', 'A1', 15),
  ('573028cf-4ae3-591d-9c4d-d0f2d10c9b67', 'restaurants', '<b>I''ll have the same</b>, but no onions, please.', 'A2', 16),
  ('e4afe638-6baa-515c-9bce-0b966de35033', 'restaurants', 'Two of those? Yeah, <b>I''ll have the same</b>.', 'A2', 17),
  ('2a26ad15-8f10-58f1-9670-7c5b73f7bee1', 'restaurants', 'Can I get the dressing <b>on the side</b>?', 'A1', 18),
  ('fe27525c-0918-5fe5-a8b8-4a3bde945912', 'restaurants', 'I''ll take the burger, but put the sauce <b>on the side</b>, please.', 'B2', 19),
  ('69165123-c34e-5907-80e5-80ba8926f230', 'restaurants', 'Fries with a little ranch <b>on the side</b> would be great.', 'A2', 20),
  ('6f867b27-8946-5769-bfe1-8c814c7bf4c5', 'restaurants', 'Can I get a large fries <b>to go</b>?', 'A1', 21),
  ('156f81b1-6a17-5faa-9ea3-0e918f325626', 'restaurants', 'Actually, could you make that <b>to go</b>? We''ve gotta run.', 'B2', 22),
  ('b8698d94-e239-523f-ad53-61fe38b1ad26', 'restaurants', 'Can we get the rest of this boxed up <b>to go</b>?', 'A1', 23),
  ('d523ed7f-22e0-5c6b-a2e7-5f6e5e61f16f', 'restaurants', '<b>For starters</b>, we''ll do the calamari and the bruschetta.', 'B2', 24),
  ('4d65c965-01fd-554c-85eb-bd0008c1b878', 'restaurants', '<b>For starters</b>, can we get an order of wings for the table?', 'B1', 25),
  ('5b37dbb8-087e-5adf-be46-9b324968a7e2', 'restaurants', 'Let''s get something <b>for starters</b> - maybe the soup?', 'B2', 26),
  ('85797c5f-d012-500a-8544-8c6ff1edd565', 'restaurants', 'Should I <b>make a reservation</b>, or do you think we can just walk in?', 'B1', 27),
  ('a484da0d-e548-57c3-b9bd-f78cad922037', 'restaurants', 'I <b>made a reservation</b> for four at seven under the name Silva.', 'B1', 28),
  ('4732ddb9-9631-56c8-ab80-ff75fb3e5263', 'restaurants', 'This place gets packed on weekends, so we''d better <b>make a reservation</b>.', 'B2', 29),
  ('66df94f9-1ef9-572b-a6f4-e57121c65f8d', 'restaurants', 'Man, that cold beer really <b>hit the spot</b> after work.', 'B2', 30),
  ('49d4136e-da5a-5c6a-9985-a6862dad9bb6', 'restaurants', 'I was starving — that burger totally <b>hit the spot</b>.', 'B2', 31),
  ('183c2230-ced5-5113-ad7b-8693959339a9', 'restaurants', 'Nothing <b>hits the spot</b> like pizza on a Friday night.', 'B2', 32),
  ('c022bc75-e6c2-5059-9d0c-d9e2b0205232', 'restaurants', 'No dessert for me, thanks — <b>I''m stuffed</b>.', 'B1', 33),
  ('90336644-54ed-5599-8155-bb58ed0cb448', 'restaurants', 'That was amazing, but <b>I''m stuffed</b>. I can''t eat another bite.', 'C1', 34),
  ('d24cebf7-67ae-5d45-9145-598d17f35fdf', 'restaurants', 'We ordered way too much. <b>I''m so stuffed</b>.', 'B1', 35),
  ('fce6a1b0-07e4-50ae-9f78-a62ab69bd37b', 'restaurants', 'After that Thanksgiving dinner I went straight into a <b>food coma</b>.', 'C1', 36),
  ('d8c83b22-c19d-5437-983a-8c244d769b1a', 'restaurants', 'I can''t move — total <b>food coma</b> right now.', 'B2', 37),
  ('3c178aba-2766-51ed-bec7-0dc8a86370df', 'restaurants', 'Careful, that much pasta will put you in a <b>food coma</b>.', 'B2', 38),
  ('78b2709c-a7c9-504d-ad5f-df4ee09422d4', 'restaurants', 'Should we just <b>split the check</b> four ways?', 'A2', 39),
  ('24dd3b82-9148-5639-8663-9fcf87afbef0', 'restaurants', 'Do you guys want separate bills, or should we <b>split the check</b>?', 'B2', 40),
  ('db6577ac-2ec6-5455-aaa7-f5d5b0faebff', 'restaurants', 'Let''s <b>split the check</b> — I''ll leave the tip.', 'B2', 41),
  ('95f85a15-09d1-5398-8031-d48e10ba84fa', 'restaurants', 'Put your wallet away — <b>it''s on me</b> tonight.', 'B2', 42),
  ('e21c63a4-814b-52e7-aa61-4c3aabdea959', 'restaurants', 'You paid last time, so tonight <b>it''s on me</b>.', 'B1', 43),
  ('0327c8a3-322c-58d4-94eb-d4935da2ae4a', 'restaurants', 'Order whatever you want, <b>it''s on me</b>.', 'A1', 44),
  ('009c642e-f730-5789-8874-db7368352e01', 'restaurants', 'It''s just <b>a hole in the wall</b>, but they make the best tacos in town.', 'B2', 45),
  ('5d184c39-c20b-5466-b3fe-172a4b42d4c1', 'restaurants', 'We found this little <b>hole-in-the-wall</b> ramen spot downtown.', 'B2', 46),
  ('c09589e0-9655-58b3-83c1-b4906557ad1e', 'restaurants', 'Don''t let the look fool you — some of the best food is at these <b>hole-in-the-wall</b> places.', 'C1', 47),
  ('c6adf283-681d-5c45-b0e8-94446cc2164b', 'shopping', '"Need help finding anything?" "No thanks, <b>just browsing</b>."', 'B1', 0),
  ('03ee3916-7c5e-5b73-b119-80f76fbbbf85', 'shopping', 'If you''re <b>just browsing</b>, no worries — I''ll be right over here if you have questions.', 'B2', 1),
  ('e7cb4cab-f921-567b-9056-843a7f688506', 'shopping', 'I went in <b>just browsing</b> and somehow walked out with three pairs of shoes.', 'B2', 2),
  ('8719c65e-0a7f-5e3e-b0ce-8d3715c3f2db', 'shopping', 'These jeans are <b>on sale</b> — thirty percent off this week.', 'B2', 3),
  ('8e5b9138-198e-5fb6-b846-1968bc4673a2', 'shopping', 'I always wait for stuff to go <b>on sale</b> before I buy it.', 'B1', 4),
  ('a423f709-a3f0-5765-bbe2-3f39c7ecded2', 'shopping', 'Are these <b>on sale</b>, or is that just the regular price?', 'A1', 5),
  ('1a445a7a-2c8c-5dbd-9ef8-56417aa1ea5a', 'shopping', 'Forty bucks for all this? That''s <b>a good deal</b>.', 'B2', 6),
  ('0d3c1d9a-83d1-53e2-b500-15f63b0fd419', 'shopping', 'You got <b>a really good deal</b> on that TV.', 'A1', 7),
  ('ad721f38-408e-5bf5-a807-7618367b52f4', 'shopping', 'Shop around a little — you might find <b>a better deal</b> online.', 'B1', 8),
  ('b80286e9-2fdb-5d59-808a-457691f696b3', 'shopping', 'I wanted the black one, but they were <b>sold out</b>.', 'A1', 9),
  ('baa68db4-d6c7-5ff9-9a3b-5f8a1b056ea4', 'shopping', 'The concert tickets <b>sold out</b> in like ten minutes.', 'B1', 10),
  ('33b0a2bc-e775-5024-aa81-d48265e4211a', 'shopping', 'Sorry, we''re <b>sold out</b> of that size right now.', 'B1', 11),
  ('dcb27ceb-3ed9-545f-8a84-54b5709b64cf', 'shopping', 'You can <b>try it on</b> — the fitting rooms are in the back.', 'A1', 12),
  ('b01d6aa7-90d6-551f-89c1-cb48f102a65a', 'shopping', 'I never buy jeans without <b>trying them on</b> first.', 'A2', 13),
  ('b2caab5d-3177-5bee-8d9d-74f4d57bff9e', 'shopping', 'Do you wanna <b>try that on</b> before you decide?', 'A2', 14),
  ('616e9fc2-591c-5dfd-ac9a-8d178859fbaa', 'shopping', 'Let me check if we''ve got that <b>in stock</b>.', 'A2', 15),
  ('392e8bc7-fc2e-5a4f-82af-eef44285de1f', 'shopping', 'Is the large <b>in stock</b>, or would I have to order it?', 'A1', 16),
  ('b4afcb88-f92a-5aa2-8182-aaaa481b4a78', 'shopping', 'They finally got the new model back <b>in stock</b>.', 'A2', 17),
  ('fb1de538-896c-5939-8d9a-3079d4718d5e', 'shopping', 'Don''t buy the first one you see — <b>shop around</b> a little.', 'B1', 18),
  ('8b6cbb39-00ae-5a6f-8aaa-f7838ae315c0', 'shopping', 'I <b>shopped around</b> and found it fifty bucks cheaper somewhere else.', 'C1', 19),
  ('9a7d4c52-90d1-5bbd-8c06-5580ee409ab1', 'shopping', 'It really pays to <b>shop around</b> before a big purchase.', 'A2', 20),
  ('4843f7fb-0acc-5f2c-b2c3-95baeb7c31e1', 'shopping', 'Ten bucks for that jacket? That''s <b>a steal</b>.', 'B2', 21),
  ('c636cd96-61c6-597f-9187-f6b705c61057', 'shopping', 'At that price it''s <b>an absolute steal</b>.', 'B1', 22),
  ('6f5e013d-050d-5693-9b4f-54f462d38ea5', 'shopping', 'The couch was practically <b>a steal</b> at the estate sale.', 'B2', 23),
  ('899d365c-bb10-5129-b5cc-c9f8668a08e2', 'shopping', 'Twelve dollars for a bottle of water? What a <b>rip-off</b>.', 'B2', 24),
  ('c6d16e76-f5e2-5ec7-b812-693e8af80189', 'shopping', 'That place is a total <b>rip-off</b> — everything''s marked way up.', 'B1', 25),
  ('79329eff-abbf-552f-b449-0931c1b15da3', 'shopping', 'I felt like I got <b>ripped off</b> on that repair.', 'B1', 26)
insert into public.sentences (id, deck_id, content, level_id, position) values
  ('ca8bda61-55a8-5afd-b03f-1cc3f90914ae', 'shopping', 'I can <b>ring you up</b> over here whenever you''re ready.', 'B1', 27),
  ('8d28873b-fbe8-5ac4-8aaa-a2b4ac29bbdf', 'shopping', 'Is somebody <b>ringing you up</b> already?', 'A2', 28),
  ('086aea32-f992-55a0-ad61-ffa68df73ac5', 'shopping', 'She <b>rang me up</b> and I was out the door in a minute.', 'B1', 29),
  ('baae91db-0d9b-5768-8efc-79006ad72547', 'shopping', 'Just <b>put it on my card</b> — I don''t have any cash on me.', 'B1', 30),
  ('af8ca44e-3e60-5707-b704-4807fd4c5761', 'shopping', 'You can <b>put it on my card</b> and I''ll pay you back later.', 'B1', 31),
  ('80754ab3-f10e-5996-a631-454787d82dba', 'shopping', 'Actually, can you <b>put it on my card</b>? The other one''s maxed out.', 'B1', 32),
  ('a8816156-347d-52f1-a8c7-75ea097bd030', 'shopping', 'There''s no line at register 3 if you want to <b>ring it up</b> over there.', 'B1', 33),
  ('1b085028-fcb9-567c-af33-b742856eb23b', 'shopping', 'Can you <b>ring me up</b>? I''m kind of in a hurry.', 'B1', 34),
  ('ac4db505-63bb-5897-9cec-76583233b19f', 'shopping', 'Wait, it <b>rang up</b> as $40 — I thought it was on sale for $25.', 'B1', 35),
  ('9d7807dd-cc91-55a7-af5b-7907041b05f3', 'shopping', 'Hey, <b>do you take cards</b>, or is this place cash only?', 'B1', 36),
  ('12e437b4-7935-5b63-8636-daa432b663cf', 'shopping', '<b>Do you guys take</b> Apple Pay?', 'B1', 37),
  ('6017b489-f841-56f4-8a4c-f37dc7a4943b', 'shopping', 'Quick question — <b>do you take</b> Amex?', 'A2', 38),
  ('f4922685-ac24-5a90-8519-8617bbbc3657', 'shopping', 'These jeans don''t fit — I''m gonna <b>take them back</b> this weekend.', 'C1', 39),
  ('74fe3e7a-bc38-5a4d-9c25-6abfe0d77362', 'shopping', 'If it doesn''t work, just <b>take it back</b>; they''re pretty good about returns.', 'C1', 40),
  ('741ccf49-07a9-58bf-bddb-e2b341d5cff8', 'shopping', 'I <b>took it back</b>, but they''d only give me store credit.', 'B1', 41),
  ('f03448ab-b8e6-5b18-8999-2f07c3180bbb', 'shopping', 'It broke after two days, so I want to <b>get my money back</b>.', 'A2', 42),
  ('945d0a9e-9b3f-5830-b19f-6a729f3acbc7', 'shopping', 'Can I <b>get my money back</b>, or is it exchange only?', 'A1', 43),
  ('95d6f3d9-dadb-5ef2-a386-6065a6376eda', 'shopping', 'Good luck <b>getting your money back</b> without a receipt.', 'B1', 44),
  ('e489bebd-26d0-54a4-950a-94a27384dd9d', 'shopping', '<b>Keep the receipt</b> just in case it doesn''t fit.', 'C1', 45),
  ('eeb5f2d8-de16-53f4-947d-64bd27c3def4', 'shopping', 'Make sure you <b>keep the receipt</b> — you can''t return anything without it.', 'B2', 46),
  ('aff3df13-4109-5344-80cc-44e983b456c9', 'shopping', 'I always <b>keep my receipts</b> for the big stuff.', 'A2', 47),
  ('8997862e-4197-5cd4-b897-af6c71dfc727', 'shopping', 'They wouldn''t refund my card, just gave me <b>store credit</b>.', 'C1', 48),
  ('b2a3add7-aea9-53ac-bc2a-834d40a02ed2', 'shopping', 'Without the receipt, the best they''ll do is <b>store credit</b>.', 'A2', 49),
  ('1d0ab164-24db-5368-9c10-2ad3bcddd5f6', 'shopping', 'I''ve got like $30 in <b>store credit</b> I need to use up.', 'A2', 50),
  ('2ae8eec6-2026-5518-bf2e-0d869b75caeb', 'shopping', 'It''s pricey, but honestly it''s <b>worth it</b>.', 'B2', 51),
  ('8d9ca4c5-ed41-5d32-8f91-6da862ae570b', 'shopping', 'Is the extended warranty even <b>worth it</b>?', 'A2', 52),
  ('683d6ca3-75f3-55da-96e5-0ddb61615144', 'shopping', 'Don''t bother — it''s really not <b>worth it</b>.', 'B2', 53),
  ('4ab5e8f4-9591-58f3-b506-47d21f5f190e', 'shopping', 'Go ahead and get it — twenty bucks <b>won''t break the bank</b>.', 'C1', 54),
  ('421d5c2e-a932-5d65-a801-c26b5fb5c15d', 'shopping', 'I wanted something nice that <b>wouldn''t break the bank</b>.', 'B2', 55),
  ('000cdeda-daa5-5418-a672-db84f9c27ea8', 'shopping', 'It''s a bit of a splurge, but it''s not gonna <b>break the bank</b>.', 'C1', 56),
  ('0be3c3ef-5f7e-5590-ba5f-1850fff27a46', 'job-interview', 'Fingers crossed — I really hope I <b>land the job</b> after that second interview.', 'B2', 0),
  ('7230d448-98a3-5e42-8c64-2b8f3b782146', 'job-interview', 'She aced the technical round, so I''d be shocked if she didn''t <b>land the job</b>.', 'C2', 1),
  ('1a045299-a9dc-5540-a983-177244882d3d', 'job-interview', 'He kept saying he''d <b>land the job</b>, and sure enough, the offer came in Friday.', 'C1', 2),
  ('96dd8254-a4fa-57e3-a15f-675c1c1304bc', 'job-interview', 'If you prepare your stories and get some sleep, you''ll <b>ace the interview</b>.', 'C1', 3),
  ('5493c73d-f4d4-51b0-90d4-ef9e9c1b0dd9', 'job-interview', 'She was nervous going in, but she totally <b>aced the interview</b>.', 'B1', 4),
  ('d8d52e88-4bcb-5655-8604-f960d72bd493', 'job-interview', 'Don''t stress — you''re way overqualified, you''re going to <b>ace the interview</b>.', 'C1', 5),
  ('c4e6d9c0-a1df-5dfe-bd65-9f4dd0e9b44e', 'job-interview', 'Don''t be shy in there — you''ve got to <b>sell yourself</b>.', 'C1', 6),
  ('14f9a258-7fbb-5bef-9273-7f30ca141b96', 'job-interview', 'He''s genuinely great at interviews because he knows how to <b>sell himself</b>.', 'C1', 7),
  ('31834a98-ca4a-596e-b8e2-feb79c9acbb2', 'job-interview', 'They asked me to <b>sell myself</b> in under two minutes, which felt impossible.', 'B2', 8),
  ('d98e2a90-db0f-5eb5-bb49-13c2d79ea097', 'job-interview', 'With your background and portfolio, you''re clearly <b>a strong candidate</b>.', 'B2', 9),
  ('a2c08ff4-4933-5b4d-894d-bc91469c268e', 'job-interview', 'They said I was <b>a strong candidate</b> but ended up going with someone else.', 'B1', 10),
  ('08b69e4e-e378-5500-9f22-cb4dad03b250', 'job-interview', 'We want to bring in <b>a strong candidate</b>, not just whoever applies first.', 'B2', 11),
  ('742ad162-d043-5fc4-8817-ac006d73f8ba', 'job-interview', 'So, <b>tell me about yourself</b> — and my mind went completely blank.', 'B2', 12),
  ('d0eb49b3-fa63-5886-aa73-179eb7a5b2c3', 'job-interview', 'Practice a sixty-second answer to “<b>tell me about yourself</b>?” before you go in.', 'B2', 13),
  ('faaf40ac-a6ab-5cf9-b24b-f841c82131f3', 'job-interview', 'I hate that prompt, “<b>tell me about yourself</b>,” — where am I even supposed to start?', 'C1', 14),
  ('b54b0bb7-a932-51f1-809e-f02dce9cb5bc', 'job-interview', 'They asked about <b>strengths and weaknesses</b> and I froze on the second part.', 'B2', 15),
  ('197f1e22-c35d-5213-aa62-3bedaf6a32f8', 'job-interview', 'When they ask about <b>strengths and weaknesses</b>, name a real one, not some fake weakness.', 'C1', 16),
  ('97dfe9ed-ffa0-5fdd-bf2b-e647e6673927', 'job-interview', 'For <b>strengths and weaknesses</b>, she admitted public speaking was her secret fear.', 'C1', 17),
  ('8b6934d6-94b5-58aa-80fc-27ab506fefe0', 'job-interview', 'My old colleague <b>put in a good word</b> for me, and I think it really helped.', 'B1', 18),
  ('85db4d2b-8c0c-559e-be36-887b0c72feb8', 'job-interview', 'Would you mind <b>putting in a good word</b> for me with the hiring team?', 'B1', 19),
  ('b8838682-19f5-5884-b5c6-1a5641f612dc', 'job-interview', 'He asked everyone he''d ever worked with to <b>put in a good word</b> for him.', 'B2', 20),
  ('5447f118-26c5-58d3-bf45-5ffbf35e318d', 'job-interview', 'Always <b>follow up after the interview</b> with a short thank-you note.', 'B1', 21),
  ('273a477f-dfaf-5c18-9261-c183cfcd6a18', 'job-interview', 'I <b>followed up after the interview</b> for two weeks and never heard anything.', 'B2', 22),
  ('8588b091-7a2c-55e5-b208-0818d9767fe4', 'job-interview', 'You should <b>follow up after the interview</b> — it shows you''re still interested.', 'B2', 23),
  ('699e9411-ce85-5cb7-94a4-a528e768d185', 'job-interview', 'She negotiated the salary up and <b>took the offer</b> on Wednesday.', 'B1', 24),
  ('52eeb6f9-ff4e-5d19-a553-901fc6bffc86', 'job-interview', 'I <b>took the offer</b> even though it means a much longer commute.', 'B1', 25),
  ('fe1391af-c7c7-5f23-bf86-0ecad990fb53', 'job-interview', 'Take your time and read it over — you don''t have to <b>take the offer</b> this second.', 'B1', 26),
  ('52bf9b8b-25a3-5b20-bb38-6cb60d1b08ce', 'job-interview', 'The <b>hiring manager</b> asked me one question and then handed me a laptop.', 'B2', 27),
  ('feac57bd-68f8-5dfa-877f-4a6f179003e5', 'job-interview', 'Talk to the <b>hiring manager</b> if you want the inside scoop on the role.', 'B2', 28),
  ('6aa21222-3247-59f4-bc9a-da7fbb1a9ad3', 'job-interview', 'She emailed the <b>hiring manager</b> directly and skipped the recruiter queue.', 'C1', 29),
  ('32bb647f-161a-5b67-9b40-9831a1b44a92', 'job-interview', 'He asked for a bigger base and managed to <b>negotiate the salary</b> up ten thousand.', 'C1', 30),
  ('f892d523-b195-59c8-912c-6cff5334ac60', 'job-interview', 'Never <b>negotiate the salary</b> into a corner — give a range, not one number.', 'B2', 31),
  ('8115eb45-675b-574f-86aa-1b899fb819d3', 'job-interview', 'I was too scared to <b>negotiate the salary</b> at my first real job.', 'B2', 32),
  ('28b447aa-2872-5926-8dbf-a7d446d0de06', 'job-interview', 'The offer''s ready as soon as the <b>background check</b> comes back.', 'B1', 33),
  ('b690e55b-2f95-52b0-a98c-cea79c4833d9', 'job-interview', 'They''re running a <b>background check</b>, so don''t fudge your start date.', 'C1', 34),
