  ('f57f4061-4602-5dd2-a086-3f77c5f6af56', 'weather-seasons', 'The <b>seasons are shifting</b> earlier than usual this year.', 'B1', 90),
  ('bdea6bd3-cc12-5d40-9ec9-136edd479b0b', 'weather-seasons', 'You can really see the <b>seasons shifting</b> in the trees.', 'A2', 91),
  ('3ebcb349-6cd6-5a51-96c5-881769555be7', 'weather-seasons', 'It feels like the <b>seasons are shifting</b> and winter''s getting shorter.', 'B1', 92),
  ('8cff6de5-bc01-5abf-a4dc-3f71c5922a35', 'weather-seasons', 'I love the <b>change of seasons</b> — each one feels fresh.', 'B1', 93),
  ('3246cb73-52d6-5408-9e06-10c8e84865c8', 'weather-seasons', 'The <b>change of seasons</b> always messes with my allergies.', 'B2', 94),
  ('5edfad37-b587-5754-8df4-0c964ef75487', 'weather-seasons', 'That first <b>change of seasons</b> hits differently when you''re new here.', 'B1', 95),
  ('12e10e52-b5ce-56ba-88bd-5a6877a2a112', 'weather-seasons', 'We should <b>make the most of the weather</b> while it lasts.', 'A1', 96),
  ('7548588c-eec7-5754-a787-a51e08bd4e55', 'weather-seasons', 'Let''s <b>make the most of the nice weather</b> and eat outside.', 'B1', 97),
  ('cc364e77-c539-5e8c-beaf-16962cb2506d', 'weather-seasons', 'She <b>made the most of the sunshine</b> and washed all the windows.', 'B1', 98),
  ('86ee4e2f-2edc-5711-9f37-147c276bf048', 'weather-seasons', 'The weather''s <b>turning</b> — I can feel it in my knees.', 'A2', 99),
  ('535fa84a-2806-5653-9878-96b4ad69ff96', 'weather-seasons', 'It looks like the season is <b>turning</b> toward autumn.', 'B1', 100),
  ('8fd6fad1-b4b9-576b-a25e-9e2c8ce2dad3', 'weather-seasons', 'When the leaves turn yellow, you know the year is <b>turning</b>.', 'A2', 101),
  ('9d0d7501-c1a3-5eb8-87dd-fa0ac1dd2caa', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Let me make a quick <b>grocery list</b> before we head to the store.', 'B1', 0),
  ('68e65304-b0eb-588b-b636-39e4fff9b1d9', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>grocery list</b> is on the fridge — did you grab it?', 'B1', 1),
  ('f131e018-f91b-5280-95d2-0720ed533fbe', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I forgot the <b>grocery list</b> at home and just guessed everything.', 'B1', 2),
  ('271e21eb-65c0-579e-b4ed-4fde04871e91', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Grab a <b>shopping cart</b> and I''ll start in the produce section.', 'B2', 3),
  ('bba51705-c303-5142-af8f-3f359a9e82b1', 'groceries-supermarket', 'There are no more <b>carts</b> left — it''s packed today.', 'B1', 4),
  ('6a6b07cc-cec6-5522-85d0-b248eb3e5e73', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We got the last <b>shopping cart</b> and skipped straight to the bakery.', 'B1', 5),
  ('bf1b126a-731c-590b-aa5e-45f3e7f7712c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The chips are on <b>aisle six</b>, next to the soda.', 'B2', 6),
  ('fc5cc8c7-9ef7-5e84-bc80-1932fbea9529', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I can never find the pasta in this maze of <b>aisles</b>.', 'B2', 7),
  ('e5881388-d948-55a4-8003-8200a2fa56f1', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The manager restocks every <b>aisle</b> overnight.', 'B2', 8),
  ('97d0dac9-f029-5b42-8485-d3a7ba8c022a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They''re <b>out of stock</b> on eggs again — so annoying.', 'B2', 9),
  ('048c1a1d-63f1-51be-85b9-75c3e1017bb9', 'groceries-supermarket', 'My favorite cereal is <b>out of stock</b>, so I grabbed another brand.', 'B2', 10),
  ('5ba45c99-cd22-5f54-ae4e-6eada5d7197a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The clerk checked the back, but that size was <b>out of stock</b> too.', 'A2', 11),
  ('bc297f08-59e7-5528-bab4-6a01f74440cd', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>produce</b> here is always fresh, so I do most of my shopping here.', 'B1', 12),
  ('960b42b2-b533-544d-a19d-855727d475e5', 'groceries-supermarket', 'He forgot the <b>produce</b> entirely — came home with no vegetables.', 'B2', 13),
  ('f68d5217-0c55-52f6-a6ae-7584092117d7', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I bought way too much <b>produce</b> this week and half of it went bad.', 'B2', 14),
  ('f13d8ac3-1987-56c6-9b9d-cf596c45a87b', 'groceries-supermarket', 'There''s no line at register four, so let''s <b>check out</b> there.', 'B1', 15),
  ('6b0fd3c1-2c5d-512f-abdf-6eda283c3503', 'groceries-supermarket', 'You can <b>check out</b> with the cashier or use self-service.', 'A2', 16),
  ('776a9737-8529-5f8d-a736-8b54c199a56a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She <b>checked out</b> before I even grabbed the milk.', 'B1', 17),
  ('90e0412d-d51c-5054-9274-d1bdecc0afd7', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Can you <b>ring this up</b> for me? I''m in a hurry.', 'A2', 18),
  ('db8ba6d1-f014-567b-b6d7-c90c0f1b4589', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The cashier <b>rang it up</b> twice by accident, so watch your receipt.', 'C1', 19),
  ('c5b77b23-b44f-590f-8b30-893475da02a7', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Just <b>ring up</b> the boxed stuff; the bread is separate.', 'B1', 20),
  ('3982da22-41ed-5796-8a79-a4743cdfa9f1', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The clerk at the <b>register</b> was really friendly.', 'A1', 21),
  ('c05d7626-695d-59b3-b94c-a7630ac869c2', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The line for the <b>register</b> was absurd — I almost left my cart.', 'B1', 22),
  ('da4cadc6-ab23-5234-86c5-e99f7300ea94', 'groceries-supermarket', 'He scanned my coupon at the <b>register</b> and knocked off two dollars.', 'B2', 23),
  ('32d320c0-1c83-5858-ad67-a2eb18e26523', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I have a <b>coupon</b> for the detergent if it''s on sale.', 'B1', 24),
  ('fbfdea12-a729-5b01-8a21-fd33ec99d802', 'groceries-supermarket', 'These <b>coupons</b> expired on Sunday — check the date first.', 'B2', 25),
  ('167dde9a-6a5c-57f2-bedf-83002f6240f4', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They didn''t accept the <b>coupon</b> because I bought the small boxes.', 'C1', 26),
  ('6c5f51e8-0ce3-5fc8-ba38-9fda6dacdf21', 'groceries-supermarket', 'My <b>loyalty card</b> earns me rewards on groceries.', 'B2', 27),
  ('99a07a99-4ac4-52b6-b801-efab4dc887a3', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She''d forget her <b>loyalty card</b> even if it were attached to her hand.', 'C1', 28),
  ('49ef982b-8776-5cb1-8112-38185d26c355', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Sign up for our <b>loyalty card</b> and you''ll save on this purchase.', 'B1', 29),
  ('50f7974e-31fe-51fa-a56f-644bb1bf96d2', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Check the <b>sell-by date</b> before you buy the discounted yogurt.', 'B1', 30),
  ('66af2aec-4a9c-52b9-8bb1-1196fedc2352', 'groceries-supermarket', 'These look fine now, but the <b>sell-by date</b> is tomorrow.', 'B1', 31),
  ('69c9d5ee-6341-5bba-8fdb-cad2bb3cab9c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I grabbed the milk without checking the <b>sell-by date</b> — rookie move.', 'C1', 32),
  ('bc2d693b-3a22-51a5-869b-183cf449d17a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Strawberries are <b>in season</b> right now, so they''re actually cheap.', 'B1', 33),
  ('8a3d4308-ae2d-5b7b-8eac-e3f716b6dcb4', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Asparagus is <b>in season</b> and it''s everywhere at the market.', 'A2', 34),
  ('0a408329-3cbd-5eaa-9265-0db3b6b66723', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I only buy tomatoes when they''re <b>in season</b> — they taste like nothing otherwise.', 'C1', 35),
  ('e20d6226-f4ff-5d66-b901-57597318636a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I''ll do a quick errand to the store <b>and pick up a few things</b> for tonight.', 'C1', 36),
  ('62441fcf-e917-5115-aeed-0d6fc599b2c3', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She went out to <b>pick up a few things</b> and came home with half the store.', 'B2', 37),
  ('c7e56001-5aac-5843-b92a-590195e7dc81', 'groceries-supermarket', '<b>Pick up</b> some lemons while you''re at the market, please.', 'B2', 38),
  ('38bf9dbc-2bf5-584c-a4c8-38abe7b52074', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I need to <b>restock the pantry</b> before the weekend guests arrive.', 'C1', 39),
  ('c805a8b6-4fb9-5527-a84d-a24a264dab70', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We <b>restocked the fridge</b> on Sunday and it''s already empty.', 'C1', 40),
  ('449f2af4-48dd-5aa0-a8e0-b8ef7dc0ec0b', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Time to <b>restock</b> on coffee — we''re almost out.', 'B1', 41),
  ('946e473e-d9fa-556c-bc50-c1940587cb05', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>deli counter</b> is a bit crowded at lunch hour.', 'B2', 42),
  ('d6c39498-2284-54d8-a12b-deef18b199c8', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Get the sliced turkey from <b>the deli</b> — it''s cheap this week.', 'C1', 43),
  ('7ffe8f63-53ad-5831-bf9d-ef604c60b67d', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She works <b>at the deli counter</b>, so she gets first pick.', 'B1', 44),
  ('febcab54-e834-51bb-806b-3b230fe2b169', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Pick up a fresh loaf from the <b>bakery</b> while you''re here.', 'C1', 45),
  ('14507a67-b4c5-5796-9de4-80039442d97c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>bakery</b> always smells amazing in the morning.', 'B2', 46),
  ('b3d23276-219e-516a-892c-ae530374541d', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Their <b>fresh bread</b> is gone by noon on Saturdays.', 'B2', 47),
  ('dcd46ad7-49d8-553c-9a22-66cd1661a719', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>frozen section</b> has pizza for a dollar on sale this week.', 'B2', 48),
  ('7c69498a-c0e4-55bc-aaa7-8fc582bcdbe6', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Frozen vegetables are underrated — the <b>freezer aisle</b> is your friend.', 'C1', 49),
  ('4853f271-7df8-5d7f-bdd4-265e787f0774', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Grab a bag of frozen peas from the <b>frozen foods</b> for your knee.', 'C1', 50),
  ('87d2dc82-4c3a-5e5f-a008-cc8d5bc0a51f', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Milk and eggs live in the <b>dairy section</b>.', 'B2', 51),
  ('68c2e10b-6a7e-5eb9-ba37-1e2268e85ee7', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>dairy cooler</b> is leaking again, watch your shoes.', 'B2', 52),
  ('141064ac-b8ab-5080-a95c-f729e8a6c191', 'groceries-supermarket', 'He loaded up on cheese from the <b>dairy department</b>.', 'B1', 53),
  ('f85dc61a-f3b5-58ae-8b21-ad6910f7032c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Everything <b>organic</b> here costs twice as much.', 'B2', 54),
  ('a5a0150c-e533-55fc-9bab-2708833dd9dd', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She only buys <b>organic</b> produce for the kids.', 'B1', 55),
  ('dce07310-c6fc-5fff-9e7f-107170f94d47', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Is this <b>organic</b>, or just labeled like it is?', 'A2', 56),
  ('f4b9c9ba-3a38-576f-894a-4f4504752319', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>seasonings aisle</b> has everything from cumin to cardamom.', 'C1', 57),
  ('661f09be-e924-533c-9c23-d341372113a5', 'groceries-supermarket', 'You''ll find tinned beans in the <b>condiments aisle</b>.', 'B2', 58),
  ('92f1053a-9a8a-5212-96e0-3d6797875484', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Spices are cheaper in the <b>bulk section</b> than the jars.', 'B2', 59),
  ('9e10dd19-ab4c-5d24-b151-45fee44914cb', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We <b>buy in bulk</b> at the warehouse store once a month.', 'B1', 60),
  ('3eed209a-826e-54a8-aa4b-06e42c3647dc', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Buying <b>in bulk</b> only pays off if you actually use it.', 'B1', 61),
  ('fcb49436-7386-5004-9b61-bebb1ab2e54c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They <b>bought in bulk</b> and filled the whole garage.', 'B2', 62),
  ('aa0be1d2-7b5e-5a99-bac5-0f60bfbfca6d', 'groceries-supermarket', 'There''s a free <b>sample</b> table by the bakery today.', 'B1', 63)
insert into public.sentences (id, deck_id, content, level_id, position) values
  ('559e76c0-4b0b-52cb-9a75-17cd2d32227d', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She always grabs three <b>samples</b> of the cheese.', 'B2', 64),
  ('c8e31caf-24db-5796-9405-b4585b3b02ed', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Try the <b>sample</b> before you commit to the big block.', 'B1', 65),
  ('8ed9c3d5-7781-57df-95a9-d4f93d3d0ca0', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I just need a few things, so a <b>basket</b> beats a cart today.', 'B1', 66),
  ('3c9b48c7-1264-52e1-b7c8-db0f078d41e4', 'groceries-supermarket', 'He carried the <b>hand basket</b> around for an hour.', 'B1', 67),
  ('d8b7de3e-3ef4-5a0e-b774-65e126d81b79', 'groceries-supermarket', 'For two items, just grab a <b>basket</b> instead of a cart.', 'B1', 68),
  ('e67679fe-63ef-59e2-a8eb-64920c7c8f40', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Do you want <b>paper or plastic</b>?', 'A1', 69),
  ('feb8fd77-a357-513a-a358-45090415ca25', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They charged five cents for a <b>plastic bag</b> now.', 'B2', 70),
  ('ee4b1d48-9a35-5f03-9f87-6403a0d5dee1', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I always bring my own <b>reusable bags</b> to the checkout.', 'B2', 71),
  ('dfb80bee-f696-5fb5-ae6a-63b7dae5af28', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I''ll use the <b>self-checkout</b> — I only have three items.', 'B1', 72),
  ('0d0d8635-a681-5a19-8c20-666254c265f6', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Someone messed up the <b>self-checkout</b> scale again.', 'B2', 73),
  ('378da97d-e54c-5e58-8d91-3f3d8cf654eb', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>self-service register</b> didn''t like my produce bag.', 'C1', 74),
  ('75db3fd2-f9e1-5ab4-be33-c2639f2c239c', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>weekly flyer</b> has the pork on sale starting Thursday.', 'B1', 75),
  ('54b60208-7875-55f4-bb6d-48fbc29ed9e9', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I clipped the <b>sale circular</b> offer for cereal.', 'B2', 76),
  ('a9300d06-ac89-593b-8a51-b9e0b7ad7e10', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>flyer</b> said avocados would drop to a dollar.', 'B1', 77),
  ('9a75d0cd-31aa-54ad-a4ec-4442e2413f85', 'groceries-supermarket', 'It''s <b>buy one get one</b> on orange juice this week.', 'B1', 78),
  ('4ce5f71e-0889-5229-acfa-5b6b79a0333a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'That <b>BOGO</b> deal made me buy more eggs than I needed.', 'B2', 79),
  ('ae173c01-6e18-5031-b914-614295714046', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Don''t skip the <b>buy-one-get-one</b> if you''ll use both.', 'B2', 80),
  ('ffd6af60-fbe2-536b-90dc-ee10beb6b6b3', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Can you do a <b>price check</b> on this lettuce? It''s blinking.', 'B2', 81),
  ('8d9ff3f0-0a56-5061-b339-1863717bebbb', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The scanner beeped weird, so I asked for a <b>price check</b>.', 'B2', 82),
  ('a76b68e4-3afb-5ccf-afb8-758105cfa033', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They did a <b>price check</b> and it came back a dollar lower.', 'B1', 83),
  ('bfc11e23-f050-5a42-86d1-463a3df9e0a7', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The sign said <b>two per customer</b>, so I grabbed two.', 'A2', 84),
  ('e6528efb-19d9-5dd3-bd29-f8fb6317d168', 'groceries-supermarket', 'There''s a <b>limit of two</b> on the sale items.', 'A1', 85),
  ('acf6f538-eab8-5680-be64-5d27301a92cf', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We handed the <b>limit</b> order card to the cashier.', 'B1', 86),
  ('dc8f1e06-9d39-521f-8f17-d2d57b67beef', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I <b>bag my own groceries</b> because I''m picky about packing.', 'C1', 87),
  ('bb2db4df-7afb-5c5f-8409-340f01d357de', 'groceries-supermarket', 'She asked who <b>bags the groceries</b> at this market.', 'B1', 88),
  ('f0b12582-d1ce-5776-a0d7-4016eccf2e8b', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Do you <b>bag groceries</b> here, or is it self-service?', 'B1', 89),
  ('b4d9dee1-928d-53b2-ae4f-0b9a09d0fc51', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We get our vegetables at the <b>farmer''s market</b> on Saturday.', 'B1', 90),
  ('8b9d652d-d809-5ce4-917a-77c3bb853392', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>farmers'' market</b> has the best tomatoes in town.', 'B1', 91),
  ('bfa5704a-f2c5-56f5-83d1-74473c510030', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Support your local <b>farmer''s market</b> in the summer.', 'A2', 92),
  ('c72110f4-6cd2-559b-9506-e945cbd716a2', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Check the <b>clearance section</b> for the discounted bread.', 'B1', 93),
  ('2b7dcaab-38b8-5f6c-8efb-0fed6532cbd2', 'groceries-supermarket', 'The <b>clearance rack</b> usually has sauces marked way down.', 'C1', 94),
  ('1ac1d4e9-825d-5b72-be74-009c73119b5a', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We found goggles in the <b>discount section</b> for a song.', 'A2', 95),
  ('8ed6fb65-65c1-5dac-a9c8-458041a90214', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I like to <b>do my grocery shopping</b> early on Sundays.', 'A2', 96),
  ('48c74b8a-99e0-5a3c-a2ce-776057e8d2a6', 'groceries-supermarket', 'He does his <b>grocery shopping</b> online now and never goes in.', 'A2', 97),
  ('f7d9e1a6-302e-5209-be22-4103a3503564', 'groceries-supermarket', 'We <b>do the weekly shop</b> together at the big store late.', 'A2', 98),
  ('63cfde09-08d5-5574-9201-8885c63c8a93', 'groceries-supermarket', 'Time to <b>stock up</b> on canned goods before the storms come.', 'A2', 99),
  ('f47e2c77-5a42-502b-a615-77101f17a6d2', 'groceries-supermarket', 'I always <b>stock up</b> on pasta when it goes on sale.', 'A2', 100),
  ('bd5c63e4-f457-5e95-8cbf-423ae558b513', 'groceries-supermarket', 'They <b>stocked up</b> on batteries ahead of the blackout.', 'B1', 101),
  ('1c1a10d7-ecae-51b9-8259-17bbe23c18cf', 'directions-transport', 'Go straight and <b>turn left</b> at the pharmacy.', 'B1', 0),
  ('570870e1-0fe3-5a62-ab3d-45f93300839b', 'directions-transport', 'You <b>turn right</b> two blocks up, right after the bakery.', 'B1', 1),
  ('1c9ba777-1870-5b41-82de-df6c5ea2126f', 'directions-transport', 'He <b>turned left</b> into the wrong lane and got honked at.', 'B2', 2),
  ('26ea87ef-d441-58bf-a973-c3f5e9869472', 'directions-transport', 'Just <b>go straight</b> for about a mile and you''ll see it.', 'B1', 3),
  ('937dd2b6-54fe-5c29-bb4a-bbc00dcfe383', 'directions-transport', 'I think we <b>went straight</b> when we should have turned, so we''re lost now.', 'B2', 4),
  ('5bdcfc87-5b35-531f-9327-c08c3e88e9b3', 'directions-transport', 'Stay on this road and <b>go straight</b>; the place is on your right.', 'A2', 5),
  ('5bd6f033-d4da-519b-93df-a5acc1fb826e', 'directions-transport', 'The GPS has us <b>taking the subway</b> instead of the bus — it''s faster.', 'B2', 6),
  ('58aeaf0a-cd8d-5293-9002-94799d07b284', 'directions-transport', 'We <b>took the subway</b> to the stadium and beat all the traffic.', 'B2', 7),
  ('e92bd7f9-fcae-5a0a-b518-63ac72dcec86', 'directions-transport', 'If you <b>take the subway</b>, change trains at the central station.', 'B1', 8),
  ('77d126e2-b431-574e-9736-785f576b91a5', 'directions-transport', 'I hate having to <b>transfer</b> trains during rush hour with bags.', 'B2', 9),
  ('e03b468e-eccd-57b9-bfe5-9b10562f4e8e', 'directions-transport', 'You''ll need to <b>transfer</b> to the green line at the next stop.', 'B1', 10),
  ('dd08afac-f2c6-5145-b4a3-1b2c899a5c7e', 'directions-transport', 'Travel light for the <b>transfer</b>, or you''ll be dragging bags up the stairs.', 'C1', 11),
